<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/laGu/dict/kna/2> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "लघु\t/laghu/\t\t/лагху/\tlaghu (f. laghu и laghvī) легкій. — [ἐλαχύς, ἐλαφρός, лат. levis, гот. leihts „leicht“, лит. leñgvas, lengvus, цсл. lьgъkъ „легкій\"].\tс. 260"@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:dict-attested ;
  dct:source "kna" .

